    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="73a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 73a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf heo ðonne binnon ðæs geares fæce wer geceose, ðonne ðolie heo ðære morgengeafe ⁊ ealre [þære] æhtan ðe he[o þurh þone ærran were healfde, ⁊ fon þa nyxtan frynd to þam lande ⁊ to þam æhte þæt heo ær hæfde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if then, within the space of the year, she chooses a husband, she shall lose her morning-gift and all the property which she had from her first husband, and his nearest relatives shall take the land and the property which she had held.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif heo binnan geares fæce wer geceose, þonne þolige heo þære morgengyfe ⁊ ealre þæra æhta, þe heo þurh ærran wer hæfde; ⁊ fon þa nehstan frynd to ðam landan ⁊ to þan æhtan, þe heo ær hæfde.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
